"""Cross-checks quoted in lessons 29-36 for Colgate-Palmolive.

Run from the company folder:
  python3 valuation-cross-checks.py > valuation-cross-checks-output.md

Nothing here changes the ledger or the model. Each number is arithmetic on the ledger, on a named file in
sources/ or professor-spreadsheet/, or on a replication of the professor's valuation workbook whose formulas
were read from professor-spreadsheet/originals/fcffsimpleginzu.xlsx (Valuation output sheet).
"""
